      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "With that done, the Sergeant offers a firm nod of approval. \"Welcome to the Republic Special Forces, private. You may return to the lieutenant, who shall provide you with your keycard and your standing orders.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
